          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Care Instructions",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Simple habits to keep your leather fresh</strong></p><p>Leather’s like a good relationship. The more you care, the longer it lasts.</p><p></p><ul><li>Wipe gently with a soft, dry or slightly damp cloth (no scrubbing, no drama).</li><li>Don’t expose it to too much sunlight or water as this makes the leather get tanned, but not like you’d want it to.</li><li>Skip the regular cleaners. Go for a leather-safe balm or conditioner once in a while.</li><li>Store it cool and dry. If you’re hanging it, use wide hangers for no shoulder dents.</li><li>Never machine wash, and absolutely no ironing (seriously).</li></ul><p>Take care of it, and it’ll age like fine wine.<br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_wL4rC8": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Leather Quality & Craftsmanship",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>It’s not just leather. It’s a whole mood.</strong></p><p>Every piece we make starts with handpicked leather, real, raw, and rich with texture.<br/><br/>Our artisans don’t just stitch products; they build character into every cut and curve. From soft hides to strong grain textures, we treat every product like it’s the only one.</p><p>Whether you’re wearing it or styling your home with it, our leather speaks without trying too hard.</p><p>Real leather. Real craft. No shortcuts.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
